<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's First Securities changes name.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's First Securities changes name.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's First Securities Co Ltd said on Monday it had decided to change its name to Hanwha Securities Co Ltd, effective on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the brokerage said the move was aimed at strengthening its corporate identity as a member of the Hanwha group.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
